<title>FRANCE: LVMH to make statement this morning.</title>
<headline>LVMH to make statement this morning.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>LVMH Moet Hennessy Louis Vuitton will make a statement on Wednesday morning in reaction to one by Guinness Plc and Grand Metropolitan Plc on Tuesday evening.</p>
<p>&quot;We have no comment at the moment. A statement will be made in the morning,&quot; said a spokeswoman for LVMH late on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The British companies said LVMH chairman Bernard Arnault had made them a proposal concerning a split of the champagne and cognac businesses.</p>
<p>LVMH had said on Tuesday that this was an &quot;English&quot; suggestion which it was not pursuing, adding it wanted a full merger for the drinks activities of the three companies.</p>
